# Hypnagogic Twilight — ~28 min — alpha 10 settle -> theta 6.5 twilight -> imagery hold (8<->12 float) -> soft fade
# Goal: hold the wake-sleep border for hypnagogic imagery WITHOUT falling asleep.
#       Settle in alpha, descend to a theta twilight, then a long imagery hold that
#       gently oscillates the flicker across the bright-safe imagery band while a
#       "floating frequency" keeps the drive from ever going static (anti-sleep).
# Bands: induction alpha 10 Hz; descent 10->6.5 Hz; twilight bottom 6.5 Hz (theta);
#        imagery hold oscillates 8<->12 Hz (centered on the 10 Hz imagery peak).
# Driver: ISOCHRONIC (audio `mod` = beat Hz, the preferred theta driver; 200 Hz carrier,
#         sine). Light flicker + audio pulse locked 1:1 at the same Hz throughout.
# Drift method: LFO. The imagery hold uses a sine LFO on BOTH the LED freq and the
#         audio mod (`~8:12:75000` = sine 8<->12 Hz, 75 s/cycle). The format applies one
#         LFO per field (verified: MOD_LED_FREQ + MOD_AUDIO_MOD dispatch in config_parser.c),
#         so this single slow sine simultaneously provides the 8<->12 imagery-band
#         oscillation AND the never-static "floating frequency" (Lucia) anti-sleep drift.
#         A separate breathing brightness LFO (~20:30:10000) adds texture.
# LED: cool white (200 220 255) drives imagery (white entrains; color is cortical);
#      violet-blue (90 40 200) for the theta descent/twilight mood. Four zones (mask 15).
# SAFETY (guidelines 4 + hypnagogic research): imagery flicker kept <=12 Hz for the
#   whole session (below the 15-25 Hz photosensitive strobe band); NO rate ever reaches
#   13 Hz+ at bright levels. Brightness capped <=30% (imagery hold ~20-30% breathing).
#   No saturated-red strobe, no red<->blue alternation (cool white / soft violet-blue only).
#   Brightness ramps IN 15 s and fades OUT 240 s (both >= the required minimums);
#   isochronic carrier 200 Hz (<1000). Anti-sleep by design (floating drift), not pro-sleep.
#
# Ramp convention = animate-on-start (guidelines 5a): the > prefix sits on the row where a
# segment BEGINS; its value is the start; the target is the next same-channel/field row.

# --- Settle / induction (00:00-05:00, 10 Hz alpha): vol + light fade in ---
0 10 50 >0 200 220 255 15   # LED 10 Hz cool white, brightness ramps 0->25% over 15 s
A 0 200 0 >0 10 1                 # isochronic: 200 Hz carrier pulsed at 10 Hz; vol fades 0->50 over 60 s
S 3000 default 20 "Let your eyes rest closed and soften your gaze."
15000 10 50 25 200 220 255 15   # brightness reaches 25% (ramp-in >=15 s done)
30000 10 50 ~20:30:10000 200 220 255 15   # breathing brightness LFO 20<->30% over 10 s
A 60000 200 0 100 10 1             # vol settled 50, beat holds 10 Hz (alpha induction)

# --- Descent to theta twilight (05:00-12:00, 10->6.5 Hz) ---
300000 >10 50 ~20:30:10000 90 40 200 15   # LED freq ramps 10->6.5 over 6 min; mood shifts violet-blue
A 300000 200 0 100 >10 1           # isochronic beat ramps 10->6.5 lockstep with the light
S 305000 default 20 "Drifting down now, toward the twilight edge between waking and sleep."
660000 6.5 50 ~20:30:10000 90 40 200 15   # twilight bottom 6.5 Hz, held ~1 min
A 660000 200 0 100 6.5 1           # beat 6.5 Hz twilight dwell

# --- Twilight / imagery hold (12:00-24:00, oscillate 8<->12 Hz, float drift) ---
720000 ~8:12:75000 50 ~20:30:10000 200 220 255 15   # LED freq floats 8<->12 Hz (75 s/cycle); cool white for imagery
A 720000 200 0 100 ~8:12:75000 1   # isochronic beat floats 8<->12 Hz, locked 1:1 with the light
S 725000 default 20 "Let images and colors arise — watch them, without holding on."
S 1080000 default 20 "Rest at the border. Notice the shapes drift and change."

# --- Soft fade (24:00-28:00): flicker settles to 10 Hz, brightness + vol fade to 0 over 4 min ---
1440000 10 50 >30 200 220 255 15   # oscillation ends, steady 10 Hz; brightness fades 30->0 over 240 s
A 1440000 200 0 >100 10 1          # beat settles to 10 Hz; vol fades 50->0 over 240 s
S 1440000 default 20 "Gently returning now."
1680000 10 50 0 200 220 255 15   # end: brightness 0
A 1680000 200 0 0 10 1            # end: volume 0

S 1680000 default 20 "WAKE UP!"
S 1690000 default 40 "WAKE UP!"
S 1700000 default 50 "WAKE UP!"
S 1710000 default 60 "WAKE UP!"
